WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Really survived

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Even though I stepped on the roof last night,

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
But I can really live in it after it's patched up.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
We have an igloo

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This winter will be saved

6
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,510
I'll just say it

7
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,510
Muchuan can dig

8
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,510
We can dig too

9
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:15,510
The fire was just a little bigger yesterday

10
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:17,510
Just add less firewood in the future and that’ll be fine.

11
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,510
Go out and see how much snow it snowed last night

12
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:20,510
What's going on

13
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:28,620
You haven't eaten yet. Get out of your way and let me push you one or two.

14
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:36,220
Why can't the door open?

15
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:47,050
There is something on the head
